                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d37f52a-774d-3e57-b745-0f7c3bfa5575",
                        "entry_id": "964b873a-bc57-3203-9f87-d5a63a274cb2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To commit blasphemy; to speak against God or religious doctrine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a13cb5e2-fd07-4e37-9ef2-8387df7d872f",
                                "sense_id": "0d37f52a-774d-3e57-b745-0f7c3bfa5575",
                                "text": "But he that shall blaspheme against the Holy Ghost hath never forgiveness, but is in danger of eternal damnation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46591e94-6a43-463a-beee-ada7800c8304",
                                "sense_id": "0d37f52a-774d-3e57-b745-0f7c3bfa5575",
                                "text": "Thus from the holy Warres are we return'd, / To ſlumber in the Summer of ſoft peace, / Since thoſe proud enemies that late blaſpheamd / And ſpit their furies in the face of Heaven, / Are now laid low in duſt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a89d295-b061-4727-aa78-7c5580a5d3c4",
                                "sense_id": "0d37f52a-774d-3e57-b745-0f7c3bfa5575",
                                "text": "Mrs. Murphy: Don't you blaspheme in here!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bad5d7d7-f361-3638-b84f-1a33d9f19738",
                        "entry_id": "964b873a-bc57-3203-9f87-d5a63a274cb2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To speak of, or address, with impious irreverence; to revile impiously (anything sacred)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fca709c-3feb-4383-92ac-d2673651c528",
                                "sense_id": "bad5d7d7-f361-3638-b84f-1a33d9f19738",
                                "text": "So Dagon ſhall be magnifi'd, and God, / Beſides whom is no God, compar'd with Idols, / Diſglorifi'd, blaſphem'd, and had in ſcorn […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c77c7cc-6f82-4880-aff3-5cf769fafd91",
                                "sense_id": "bad5d7d7-f361-3638-b84f-1a33d9f19738",
                                "text": "How long, O Lord, holy and true, dost thou not judge and avenge thyself on all those who thus continually blaspheme thy great and all-glorious name?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "063118ef-9ef7-35ce-bbba-288c99c383ca",
                        "entry_id": "964b873a-bc57-3203-9f87-d5a63a274cb2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To calumniate; to revile; to abuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dea2c532-bc67-43cc-a3c1-835ecca09fe5",
                                "sense_id": "063118ef-9ef7-35ce-bbba-288c99c383ca",
                                "text": "You do blaspheme the good in mocking me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24842513-2a1b-4706-ae2e-84e1db77b834",
                                "sense_id": "063118ef-9ef7-35ce-bbba-288c99c383ca",
                                "text": "Those who from our labours heap their board, / Blaspheme their feeder and forget their lord."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4674c545-8645-41e3-b4c5-6a0520c12b79",
                        "source_entry_id": "964b873a-bc57-3203-9f87-d5a63a274cb2",
                        "source_sense_description": "to speak against God or religious doctrine",
                        "target_lang_word": "rouhat se",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rouhat se",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ef912d6-64e8-3438-9f44-e4074e9a23e4",
                                        "entry_id": "71d55f78-7216-34f8-92c5-1c45406b9093",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(rouhat se + někomu, něčemu) vést řeči nebo dopouštět se skutků, které napadají, urážejí, tupí, zostuzují, zpochybňují, činí předmětem posměchu apod. vyšší jsoucno (např. Boha), hodnotné ideje, cíle, postavení vážené osoby (např. panovníka), instituce (např. církve) apod."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e219c0d7-6ee8-4ce1-a4f5-80b7aa093558",
                                                "sense_id": "1ef912d6-64e8-3438-9f44-e4074e9a23e4",
                                                "text": "A každému, kdo řekne slovo proti Synu člověka, bude odpuštěno, ale tomu, kdo by se rouhal Duchu Svatému, odpuštěno nebude."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78c1e72f-ad21-320e-87eb-1c150ddbf749",
                                        "entry_id": "71d55f78-7216-34f8-92c5-1c45406b9093",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "být příliš neskromný a proto si stěžovat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44dbefa3-487f-4728-941e-afe75f3594e2",
                                                "sense_id": "78c1e72f-ad21-320e-87eb-1c150ddbf749",
                                                "text": "Pane doktore, až uslyšíte, proč jsem tady, řeknete mi: „Ženská, nerouhejte se, běžte domů a buďte ráda, že se máte tak dobře.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cf5d222-d059-46d9-81da-a08de8c06953",
                                                "sense_id": "78c1e72f-ad21-320e-87eb-1c150ddbf749",
                                                "text": "„Co v Paříži pohledával?“ „Kul pikle, jak jinak, s huguenoty a se Španěly.“ „Ne! Nevěřím, kul-li pikle, pak s paní de Chevreuse proti mé cti.“ „Nerouhejte se, Veličenstvo. Královna je moudrá a miluje vás.“ „Ženy jsou křehké nádoby a o její lásce ke mně mám své mínění.“"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b6322fe-6a08-4166-8e28-67b10acf7650",
                        "source_entry_id": "964b873a-bc57-3203-9f87-d5a63a274cb2",
